Track 1: Bearing Drift
- Story & Context: Deep beneath Sector 4, the particle accelerator's cooling pipes burst during the inaugural set, spraying coolant across the Hohner Clavinet as the crowd watched in terrified awe. Elias, the lead programmer, scrambled to fix the feed while the machine roared, "Hold the wire until the harbor sings," as the floor turned into a slick, shivering ice rink. The sound of the short-circuiting instrument became the foundation of the scene's first anthem.
